{"shortname": "anytxt", "name": "AnyTXT Searcher", "_id": "5cd2d0509d8bdd77f1d4d34f", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/anytxt/", "private": false, "short_description": "  AnyTXT Searcher is a powerful file full-text search engine, a desktop search application for fast document retrieval.  Just like a local disk Google search engine, much faster than Windows Search, it is your ideal desktop file content full-text search engine.\r\n  It has a powerful document parsing engine built in, which extracts the text of commonly used file formats without installing any other software, and combines the built-in high-speed indexing system to store the metadata of the text. You can quickly find any text in any file on your disk  by Anytxt almost in 0.1 second.  It works on Windows 11,10, 8, 7, Vista, XP, 2008, 2012, 2016,2022...\r\nAnyTXT Searcher supports the following file formats:\r\nPlain text (txt, cpp, py, html, etc.)\r\nMicrosoft OneNote (one)\r\nMicrosoft Word (doc, docx)\r\nMicrosoft Excel (xls, xlsx)\r\nMicrosoft PowerPoint (ppt, pptx)\r\nPDF \r\nWPS Office (wps, et, dps)\r\nEBook  (epub, mobi, azw3, fb2 etc.)\r\nMind Map Format (lighten, mmap, mm, xmind etc.)\r\nOFD\r\n.....", "creation_date": "2019-05-08", "summary": "A Powerful Desktop Full-Text Search Engine,  Just Like Local Google. ", "external_homepage": "https://anytxt.net", "video_url": null, "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": "https://twitter.com/AnyTXT_Searcher", "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": "https://www.facebook.com/Anytxt", "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Fediverse"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Instagram"}], "status": "active", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "_url", "preferred_support_url": "https://anytxt.net/forums", "developers": [{"username": "anytxt", "name": "Ming Yuan", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/anytxt/"}], "tools": [{"name": "activity", "mount_point": "activity", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/anytxt/activity/"